This product includes software developed as original work for the Libella
project (Apache-2.0).

Architecture ideas were informed by study of the following open-source
projects (no source code copied; all implementation is original):

- ARTEX (Autumn-27/ARTEX, AGPL-3.0; studied via BaaRai/ARTEX English fork)
- strix (usestrix/strix, Apache-2.0)
- PentestGPT (GreyDGL/PentestGPT, MIT)
- hermes-agent (NousResearch/hermes-agent, MIT)
- PentAGI (vxcontrol/pentagi, MIT)
- hexstrike-ai (0x4m4/hexstrike-ai, MIT)
- Pentest-Swarm-AI (Armur-Ai/Pentest-Swarm-AI, AGPL-3.0)
- shannon (KeygraphHQ/shannon, AGPL-3.0)

Runtime tool binaries (installed separately or in the Docker image) carry
their own licenses: nmap (NPSL), nuclei/httpx/subfinder (MIT), ffuf (MIT),
OWASP Juice Shop (MIT), PairLab (Apache-2.0, this repo). Libella invokes
these as subprocesses and does not link or derive from their code.